  'fr.badgeAbsent': 'Must NOT have happened',
  'fr.absentNote': 'This is the half of the rule that expresses innocence. A matching event arriving within the grace delay DISARMS the rule instead of firing it — that is what stops a legitimate badge entry being reported as an intrusion.',
